{"time": 1755671837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1381033897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2031312586]（）"}
{"time": 1755671868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1007037716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“嗯。。。你觉得，是花火这个名字好听呢，还是圣杯战争指定观测者、监护者，多米尼克好听呢”"}
{"time": 1755671885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1236171951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“选一个吧！喜欢哪个就用哪个”"}
{"time": 1755671954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1531866726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=708742760]（）"}
{"time": 1755671989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1120736984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“哎呀，这么小心谨慎”"}
{"time": 1755672009, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1211212845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“小心是件好事，但是多多少少有点无聊哦”"}
{"time": 1755672057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1796715519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“来找我有什么事吗？你们已经击败了敌人吗？”"}
{"time": 1755672061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "507434271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1236171951]“那么尊敬可爱善良体贴大方的花火大人，能否原谅先前我失礼的举动呢，我很抱歉，但是在遇到您之前我们已经被试探了多次，不得不谨慎一些”"}
{"time": 1755672078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "142890684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1796715519]（这个后发）"}
