{"time": 1755779792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "969831039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“你从万神庙全速赶到天文台要多久？”"}
